    "text": "UNIQUE PLUCK -- The top card of your deck is revealed at all times. -- BOTTOM DEAL -- COST: Pay 1. -- EFFECT: Put the top card of your deck on the bottom. -- CHEAT -- COST: Deplete this card. -- EFFECT: Reveal the top card of your deck. You may deploy it. (You can't play resources with this ability.) -- CHANGE COSTUME -- COST: Pay 3. Shuffle this card into its owner's deck. -- EFFECT: Search your deck for a pluck card with a different name than this card and reveal it. Put it into play under your control.",
    "markup": "<keywords><unique>PLUCK</unique></keywords><rule>The top card of your deck is revealed at all times.</rule><ability name=\"BOTTOM DEAL\" ref=\"bottomdeal\"><cost>Pay 1.</cost><effect>Put the top card of your deck on the bottom.</effect></ability><ability name=\"CHEAT\" ref=\"cheat\"><cost>Deplete this card.</cost><effect>You may look at and play the top card of your deck.</effect></ability><ability name=\"CHANGE COSTUME\" ref=\"costume\"><cost>Pay 3. Shuffle this card into its owner's deck.</cost><effect>Search your deck for a \"<subtype>pluck</subtype>\" card with a different name than this card and put it into play.</effect></ability>",
    "subtitle": "wicked...tricksy...false...we hates him",
