    "markup": "<ability><cost>Pick a value for X. Deplete X characters you control. Then, pick a character.</cost><effect>If the character has X+X strength or less, destroy it.</effect></ability>",
    "subtitle": "a morning well spent",
    "flavorText": "\"If even one thing is wrong, even the slightest thing, a bad phrase, spilt salt, weak posture, anything at all...the consequences can be horrific. Exploded, melted, turned inside out, consumed by fire, filled with pudding...the 12 Man Brunch has finished many a cocksure arcanist.\"\n— Werner Geisen, Master Ritualist",
