    "text": "INFLUENCE = 15+(10*X). X is the number of opponents you have at the start of the game. (You start with 15 + 10 times X influence.) -- STARTING RESOURCES: Any 1+X staple resources. -- STARTING DRAW: 7 going first, 8 going second. -- RESTORE RULE: At the start of your turn, restore all your depleted cards and detach all resources from your faction. -- DEVELOP RULE: At the start of your turn, draw a card or play a resource. Repeat this X-1 times. -- DRAW -- COST: Pay 3. -- EFFECT: Draw a card. -- RESOURCE -- COST: Pay 3. -- EFFECT: Play a resource. -- ENTICEMENT -- COST: Use this only during your turn, and only once per turn. -- EFFECT: Draw X-1 cards. Play a resource. Put the top card of the Hero deck into the Temptation Pile. -- DARING GAMBIT -- If a Hero inflicts at least 7 damage to another Hero this turn, the damaging Hero claims the entire Temptation Pile. -- OMNIPOTENCE -- You automatically meet all thresholds, even if you don't control the proper resource icons. -- (See the included Showdown rules card for more details.)",
