    "subtitle": "the collision of magic and antimagic",
    "flavorText": "\"Battles raged long before war came to Marduun, but when war came, the sky stayed lit for half a century with brilliant blazes of might and destruction.\"\n— Marduun, a Forgotten History authored by the Right Honorable Basel E. Corgington, Esq",
