    "text": "UNIQUE CONTIGUOUS DEFALCATING MACHINE -- When a character enters play, its controller must choose one of the following: -- OPTION 1 -- Put a resource they control into its owners's hand. -- OPTION 2 -- Destroy that character. -- OPTION 3 -- Their faction loses 3 influence.",
    "markup": "<keywords><unique>CONTIGUOUS DEFALCATING MACHINE</unique></keywords><rule>If a character enters play, its controller must choose one of the following:</rule><option label=\"OPTION 1\"><rule>Put a resource they control into its owner's hand.</rule></option><option label=\"OPTION 2\"><rule>Destroy that character.</rule></option><option label=\"OPTION 3\"><rule>Their faction loses 3 influence.</rule></option>",
    "subtitle": "not quite what it sounds like",
